AUDIO: 'around. The risk in a local agentic setup isn\'t what you type, it\'s what arrives. Your agent fetches a web page, reads a PDF, pulls a document. That content came from somewhere you don\'t control. Shieldstraw gives you a screen'

[12:15] [scene:talk]
